Original Work (Developed from scratch for CobolScope)
================================================================================
The following components are original works created specifically for CobolScope
and are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

1. CobolScope Core Engine (Python):
   - All modules in `cobolscope/` (AST hydration, call graph builder, reachability
     analyzer, CFG generation, data dictionary reconciler, portal generator, CLI).
   - Test suites in `tests/` and test harness tools in `tests/harness/`.
   - HTML/CSS/JS Jinja2 templates in `cobolscope/templates/`.

2. Original Java Pipeline & Extraction Classes (`java/`):
   - `java/AsgSemanticAuditor.java`
     Custom AST/ASG verification oracle.
   - `java/CobolTextCleaner.java`
     Custom token and context string cleaner.
   - `java/DataDivisionExtractor.java`
     Custom Data Division, REDEFINES, and memory layout extractor.
   - `java/HeaderDivisionExtractor.java`
     Custom Identification & Environment Division extractor.
   - `java/IrJsonWriter.java`
     Custom zero-dependency JSON serialization engine.
   - `java/IrModel.java`
     Custom Canonical IR Data Transfer Object (DTO) hierarchy.
   - `java/ProcedureDivisionExtractor.java`
     Custom Procedure Division hierarchy extractor.
   - `java/ProLeapCliRunner.java`
     Custom CLI runner orchestrator and streaming JSON pipeline.
   - `java/StatementMapper.java`
     Custom open polymorphic statement mapping engine.
   - `java/io/proleap/cobol/preprocessor/CobolPreprocessorResult.java`
     Custom container for preprocessed source and line coordinates.
   - `java/io/proleap/cobol/preprocessor/CobolSourceMap.java`
     Custom interval-tree coordinate mapping across copybook expansions.
   - `java/io/proleap/cobol/preprocessor/CobolSourceMapContext.java`
     Custom thread-local and global registry for active source maps.

